    <headline>Budhi Gandaki flood: 136 houses destroyed from Lokpa to Chumling (BIPAD)</headline>
    <description>BIPAD portal, as of 11:21 AM Asoj 26 (12 Oct 2026): 136 houses destroyed from Lokpa to Chumling, Dharche-5. 140 livestock lost at Ungilung (BIPAD spells it Uingurlung); BIPAD records this as an avalanche. These are BIPAD's figures and are not added to the NDRRMA press-note figures.</description>
